Package: cellchatr
Title: Fast Ligand-Receptor Interaction Screening for Single-Cell Data Using Rust
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mayank", "Gandhi", , "135.mayankgandhi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-3448-9308"))
Description: Fast identification of over-expressed genes and
    ligand-receptor interactions in single-cell RNA-seq data, the
    pre-processing steps of cell-cell communication analysis tools such as
    CellChat. Works directly on SummarizedExperiment and
    SingleCellExperiment objects and accepts any ligand-receptor table
    (for example the CellChatDB interaction table). The per-gene,
    per-cell-group Wilcoxon rank-sum tests are implemented in Rust via
    extendr and run in parallel with Rayon.
